# tools/linux-env/probes-argv.manifest - argv and stdin for the probes that
# tools/linux-env/probes-initramfs.sh runs in the image.
#
# One line per probe:  probe name | argv words | stdin file (repo-relative, may be empty)
# Argv words are split on spaces; quoting is not supported. The stdin file is copied into
# the image as /tests_kernel/<probe>.stdin and redirected to the probe. A probe with no
# line runs with no argument and no stdin, as before.
#
# probe_peloader takes --batch and reads one path per line from stdin. The stdin file is
# the input list that tests/differential/capture_golden.py gives it (pe_inputs, in that order).
probe_peloader | --batch | tools/linux-env/probes-stdin/probe_peloader.batch
